WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:10.020 --> 00:00:11.940
It's quite an important relationship for us.

00:00:11.980 --> 00:00:17.880
The sub-tribe of Ngāi Tū Ahuriri were here
before colonial times of course and they were

00:00:17.880 --> 00:00:24.610
the original occupants of the land pre-european
settlement and we have an important relationship

00:00:24.610 --> 00:00:29.890
with them in terms of what we have to do under
the Resource Management Act but also acknowledging

00:00:29.890 --> 00:00:34.680
the fact that the important Kaiapoi Māori reserve centred on Tuahiwi, is right in the middle of our district.

